#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ewm.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ewm"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:1 of
msgid "Provide exponentially weighted (EW) calculations."
msgstr "提供指数加权（EW）计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`LiteFrameEWM` object whose aggregation methods "
"(``.mean()``, ``.std()``, ``.var()``) compute exponentially weighted "
"moving statistics."
msgstr ""
"返回一个 :class:`LiteFrameEWM` 对象，其聚合方法（``.mean()``、``.std()``"
"、``.var()``）计算指数加权移动统计量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:7 of
msgid ""
"Exactly one of ``com``, ``span``, ``halflife``, or ``alpha`` must be "
"provided to specify the smoothing factor."
msgstr ""
"必须提供 ``com``、``span``、``halflife`` 或 ``alpha`` 中的一个来指定平滑"
"因子。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:10 of
msgid "Specify decay in terms of center of mass: ``alpha = 1 / (1 + com)``."
msgstr "以质心方式指定衰减：``alpha = 1 / (1 + com)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:12 of
msgid "Specify decay in terms of span (N-day EMA): ``alpha = 2 / (span + 1)``."
msgstr "以跨度方式指定衰减（N日 EMA）：``alpha = 2 / (span + 1)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:15 of
msgid ""
"Specify decay in terms of half-life: ``alpha = 1 - exp(ln(0.5) / "
"halflife)``."
msgstr "以半衰期方式指定衰减：``alpha = 1 - exp(ln(0.5) / halflife)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:18 of
msgid "Specify smoothing factor directly: ``0 < alpha <= 1``."
msgstr "直接指定平滑因子：``0 < alpha <= 1``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:20 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in the window required to produce a value "
"(otherwise null)."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数（否则为 null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:23 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If True, use the adjusted (weighted average) form.  If False, use the "
"recursive form (y_t = (1-α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t)."
msgstr "如果为 True，使用调整（加权平均）形式。如果为 False，使用递归形式（y_t = (1-α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:26 of
msgid ""
"If False, NaN positions are treated as absolute gaps (weights decay "
"through the gap).  If True, NaN positions are ignored (weights apply only"
" to observed values, relative positioning)."
msgstr ""
"如果为 False，NaN 位置被视为绝对间隙（权重在间隙中衰减）。如果为 True，"
"NaN 位置被忽略（权重仅应用于已观测的值，相对定位）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:30 of
msgid ""
"If False, use unbiased variance (bias correction).  If True, use biased "
"variance.  Only applies to ``std``/``var``."
msgstr ""
"如果为 False，使用无偏方差（偏差校正）。如果为 True，使用有偏方差。仅适用"
"于 ``std``/``var``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:33 of
msgid "Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all numeric columns are aggregated."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为 None，则聚合所有数值列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:35 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) that define the order in which the window expands (equivalent "
"to ``ORDER BY`` inside a MaxCompute ``OVER()`` clause). The output row "
"order is unchanged; each row receives the EWM computed over the rows that"
" precede it in *order_by* order."
msgstr ""
"定义窗口展开顺序的列（等价于 MaxCompute ``OVER()`` 子句中的 "
"``ORDER BY``）。输出行顺序不变；每行接收按 *order_by* 顺序在其之前"
"的行计算得到的 EWM 值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:40 of
msgid ""
"Sort direction for each *order_by* column. A single bool is broadcast to "
"all columns."
msgstr "每个 *order_by* 列的排序方向。单个布尔值会广播到所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:43 of
msgid ""
"Offset the EWM leading edge by N rows. A positive value shifts the window"
" forward (look-ahead), a negative value backward (look-back). Matches the"
" MaxCompute ``shift`` MF-specific window parameter."
msgstr ""
"将 EWM 前沿偏移 N 行。正值将窗口向前移动（前瞻），负值向后移动（回溯）。"
"匹配 MaxCompute ``shift`` MF 特定窗口参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:48 of
msgid ""
"Flip the EWM so the recurrence runs from the last row backward (a "
"\"narrowing\" window). Matches the MaxCompute ``reverse_range`` MF-"
"specific window parameter. May be combined with ``window_shift``: the "
"window then covers ``[i + window_shift, n-1]``."
msgstr ""
"翻转 EWM，使递归从最后一行向后运行（"收缩"窗口）。匹配 MaxCompute "
"``reverse_range`` MF 特定窗口参数。可与 ``window_shift`` 组合使用："
"此时窗口覆盖 ``[i + window_shift, n-1]``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:54 of
msgid ""
"If True, restore the output to the input frame's row order and chunk "
"layout after the group-key shuffle (grouped EWM only).  If False, the "
"output stays in reducer/hash-partition order."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，在分组键重排后恢复输出到输入帧的行顺序和块布局（仅分组EWM）"
"。如果为 False，输出保持在 reducer/哈希分区顺序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:59 of
msgid "Intermediate object; call an aggregation method to produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法以生成 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:65 of
msgid ":py:obj:`rolling`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:66 of
msgid "Provide rolling-window calculations."
msgstr "提供滚动窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:68 of
msgid ":py:obj:`expanding`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:69 of
msgid "Provide expanding-window calculations."
msgstr "提供扩展窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:72 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:73 of
msgid ""
"With ``adjust=True`` (default), the EW mean at position *t* is a weighted"
" average of all observations up to *t*, where the weight for observation "
"*i* is proportional to ``(1 - alpha)^(t - i)``.  Earlier observations "
"receive exponentially decaying weights."
msgstr ""
"当 ``adjust=True``（默认值）时，位置 *t* 处的 EW 均值是截至 *t* 的所有"
"观测值的加权平均，其中观测值 *i* 的权重与 ``(1 - alpha)^(t - i)`` 成正比"
"。较早的观测值获得指数衰减的权重。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:78 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"With ``adjust=False``, the EW mean is computed recursively: ``y_0 = x_0``"
", ``y_t = (1 - α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t``.  This requires less memory but "
"weights differ slightly from the adjusted form for the first few "
"observations."
msgstr ""
"当 ``adjust=False`` 时，EW 均值以递归方式计算：``y_0 = x_0``，``y_t = (1 "
"- α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t``。这需要更少的内存，但前几个观测值的权重与调整"
"形式略有不同。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:83 of
msgid ""
"For ``std`` and ``var``, the unbiased estimator (``bias=False``) applies "
"a bias correction factor derived from the sum of weights, similar to the "
"``ddof=1`` correction in sample variance.  Set ``bias=True`` to skip this"
" correction."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``std`` 和 ``var``，无偏估计量（``bias=False``）应用一个由权重之和"
"导出的偏差校正因子，类似于样本方差中的 ``ddof=1`` 校正。设置 ``bias=True`"
"` 可跳过此校正。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.ewm:88 of
msgid ""
"See the `pandas EWM documentation "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.ewm.html>`_"
" for the mathematical background on ``adjust``, ``ignore_na``, and "
"``bias``."
msgstr ""
"有关 ``adjust``、``ignore_na`` 和 ``bias`` 的数学背景，请参阅 `pandas EWM"
" 文档 <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.ewm."
"html>`_。"

